{{!-- The Demon Hunter's Devour Soul offer (02 §7; the Demon Hunter plan's Phase 4a), posted on the active
      GM's client by `effects/demon-hunter-features.mjs#offerDevour`, so the row names its own audience
      (D-779): `data-reaction-owner` shows it to whoever owns the hunter. The press judges again before
      anything is spent. An undead creature is offered with the note that a soulless one gives nothing. --}}
<div class="azeroth azeroth-card azeroth-card-feature azeroth-dh-offer" data-message-kind="dhOffer">
  <div class="azeroth-card-body">
    <p class="azeroth-card-line azeroth-fired"><span>{{title}}</span><em>{{text}}</em></p>
    {{#if undead}}<p class="azeroth-card-line azeroth-card-note">{{localize "AZEROTH.DemonHunter.Devour.UndeadNote"}}</p>{{/if}}
    <div class="azeroth-card-actions" data-reaction-owner="{{holderUuid}}">
      <button type="button" data-action="devourSoul" data-holder-uuid="{{holderUuid}}" data-victim-uuid="{{victimUuid}}" data-scene-id="{{sceneId}}" data-token-id="{{tokenId}}">{{localize "AZEROTH.DemonHunter.Devour.Button"}}</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
